      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and skilled grooming specialists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly praise groomers including Mafer, Yasmin, Karol, Maribel, Mila, and Marco for their friendliness, patience, and attention to detail. Reviewers appreciate that stylists listen carefully to specific haircut preferences and handle dogs with genuine warmth. Aside from one mention of a lengthy appointment duration, customer sentiment regarding the staff is overwhelmingly positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle treatment for delicate pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners highlight the salon's gentle approach toward delicate and sensitive animals, including three-pound Yorkies, senior dogs, and pets with allergies. Reviewers emphasize that dogs feel pampered and relaxed rather than stressed during grooming. Longtime clients trust the team with vulnerable pets because staff take special care around joints and sensitive skin."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Precision styling and hygienic care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews consistently praise the appearance of dogs after grooming, noting neat haircuts, soft coats, and clean ear and nail hygiene. Clients appreciate that poodles, doodles, and other coated breeds receive balanced styling that holds up well between visits. Pet parents often state that their companions look and smell great upon pickup."
      }
    }
